  "s3d12": {
    "intro": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（まだつかないのかな。もう結構進んだ気がするんだけど。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（進めど進めど同じ景色で、自分がどこにいるのかすらわからなくなってきた…。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（はぁ。敵の数も増えてきたし、少なくとも進めているのかな…。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（……多分。）"
      }
    ],
    "battle_conversation": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（あの見た目、もしかして吸血鬼…！？）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "おや、久々のお客さんだ。しかも人間とは…珍しいね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "…………。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふふっボクのことを見た人間はみんなそんな顔をするよ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "それで、わざわざボクに会いに来たってことは、目的も大方予想はつくけど…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "そ、そう。それなら話は早いんだけど。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "最近この地域に入り込んだ魔族を追ってるんだけどさ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "あ、あんたならそいつがどこにいるか知ってるんでしょ？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふふっ知っているよ。そのせいでボクの下僕たちが最近騒がしいんだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "マジで？それじゃあ……"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "情報を渡すのはいいけど、キミはボクに何をくれるのかな？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "え？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "情報を得るためには対価を払うものでしょ？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "それに、わざわざこんな遺跡の深くにまで来るなんて、"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "人間たちが知り得ない、よっぽど貴重な情報だと思うけどな。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "い、いくら払えばいいの……？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふふっ普段ならキミの血液を少し分けてもらうところだけど、"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "…………っ！！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふふっそんなに驚かないで。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "今はお腹いっぱいだし、なによりキミに少し興味が湧いているんだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ボクもこうして会えるのを楽しみにしていたんだよ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……なにが言いたいの？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "キミの魔法をボクにも見せてよ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……は？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ボクと戦って、勝ったら情報を渡してあげる。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "お金もいらないし、なにより血を吸われずに済むよ？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ちょっと、戦うって…。ここまで来るのに結構苦労したんだけど。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "そう？断るっていうのなら止めないよ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "だけど、情報がないとキミのギルドでの立場が危ういんじゃないかなあ？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ど、どうしてそれを…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "わ、分かったよ。戦う、戦うから…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（い、いざとなったら逃げればいいよね。命より重いものはなし…。うぅ…。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
